<title>USA: Capitol Transamerica declares extra payout.</title>
<headline>Capitol Transamerica declares extra payout.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Wis. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capitol Transamerica Corp said Tuesday its board of directors declared an extra cash dividend of $0.10 a share, payable February 28 to shareholders of record February 14.</p>
<p>The board of directors also set the quarterly dividend rate at $0.07 a share for 1997. The rate in 1996 was $0.10 a share, but that was before a three-for-two stock split distributed January 15, the insurance holding company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
